{"id":"637100","name":"芹菜猪肉包子","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637100/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉放酵母和好，醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/637100/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芹菜焯水。","img":"images/637100/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"芹菜放绞肉机搅碎。","img":"images/637100/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱切好。","img":"images/637100/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪肉馅切好，放姜末、盐、蚝油、生抽拌匀。","img":"images/637100/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"食材放在一起，放入花椒油、芝麻油。","img":"images/637100/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/637100/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面团揉面拍气，分成均匀的剂子，擀成包子皮。","img":"images/637100/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/637100/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"全部包好，二次醒发30分钟。","img":"images/637100/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火蒸15分钟关火焖5分钟。","img":"images/637100/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/637100/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煊软、美味。","img":"images/637100/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}